%% The same run in more detail. The short version is pipeline.mmd. Source of truth: docs/how-it-works.md.
flowchart TD
    START["Choose a gene, a direction,<br/>and what is wrong with the alleles"]

    START --> PROM["Find its promoter"]
    PROM --> SCAN["Scan for spots where<br/>regulating proteins could bind"]
    SCAN --> NULL["Shuffle the same window<br/>to see how many spots<br/>chance alone would give"]
    NULL --> Q{"Anything<br/>stands out?"}
    Q -- no --> WIDE["Search a wider stretch"] --> CHECK
    Q -- yes --> CHECK["Say what each protein does,<br/>whether it is really there,<br/>and whether it is active"]
    CHECK --> DRUGS["Find approved drugs that<br/>push those proteins the right way"]

    START --> OTHER["Other routes to the same gene<br/>drugs on the gene itself<br/>on proteins further upstream<br/>on its recorded regulators<br/>reported in the literature<br/>measured to move the transcript"]

    START --> AFTER["After transcription<br/>decay exons an oligo could skip<br/>upstream ORFs in the 5'UTR<br/>decay elements in the 3'UTR<br/>the ligase that destroys the protein<br/>and the enzyme that reverses it<br/>drugs measured on the protein itself"]

    DRUGS --> NARROW["Weigh the collateral<br/>how many genes the factor runs<br/>how body-wide the factor is<br/>how many systems the drug moves<br/>whether a selective ligand can exist"]
    OTHER --> NARROW
    AFTER --> NARROW

    NARROW --> GATES["Demote what the evidence cannot carry<br/>a scan that is mostly noise<br/>a compound that just moves the cell cycle<br/>one the literature records for every gene<br/>one that damages DNA, or raises an oncogene,<br/>when the patient cannot afford either"]
    GATES --> RANK["Rank every route by<br/>how strong its evidence is"]
    CONTEXT["Context only<br/>genetic support, safe dose range"] -.-> RANK
    LEDGER["Which lookups actually answered"] -.-> RANK

    RANK --> REPORT["Write up<br/>show approved drugs<br/>say what ran and what failed<br/>and which of the six steps<br/>were never asked at all"]
    REPORT --> TEST["Test it<br/>the screen this analysis prioritises,<br/>and a check against what is already known"]
